// The first-hour trap: a 1 m rock floor over a 16 m drop (a worm shaft or cave nobody can see through rock).
// Digging down (S: the bite straight under the feet) would open the floor under the whole body and the fall
// would kill, so the bite is held back at once with one line ("The floor rings hollow: a deadly drop below.
// Dig beside it to look first.") and a warning thump; holding S longer or pressing again within 5 s doesn't
// repeat the words. Digging beside the mole still opens the floor there (the player can look, then climb or
// jump down by choice), and the mole stands on what is left.
map
